('TXT_KEY_CIVILOPEDIA_LEADERS_VILTRUM_HEADING_1','Blood and Dominion'),
('TXT_KEY_CIVILOPEDIA_LEADERS_VILTRUM_TEXT_1','Thragg, Grand Regent of the Viltrum Empire, rules through absolute strength and the preservation of Viltrumite blood. His empire must survive a catastrophe that military force cannot defeat.');
